.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Vendored ffmpeg ───────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Deliberately not committed, for two reasons that both get worse with time:
#
# - Size. ~149 MB of DLLs, executables and generated HTML. Git keeps every blob
#   forever, so committing it once puts it in the history permanently: deleting
#   it later frees nothing, and rewriting history on a shared repository is its
#   own problem.
# - Licensing. These are third-party binaries under the LGPL or GPL depending on
#   how the build was configured. Redistributing them carries obligations —
#   license notices, and an offer of corresponding source — worth taking on
#   deliberately rather than by dragging a folder in.
#
# A clone needs this present to build a working binary, since the runtime is
# unpacked on first run from what the build embeds.
/third_party/ffmpeg/

# Local tooling state, specific to one machine.
/.claude/settings.local.json
